# environment screen-legacy-hardn-only -------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: the Environment screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian$
# 13, sudo 1.9.16p2. As legacy, drawn with decision 3 (b), not$
# recommended: hardn's own files alone count.$
$
# Environment Variable Settings ################################$
$
# HARDN_CONFIG -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 alice$
  [ ] Under sudo           Not kept$
   -  Value                /home/alice/hardn.yml$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Under sudo           Keep HARDN_CONFIG$
   2) Guide                How to set HARDN_CONFIG$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
